Now we need to apply Article 11 ECHR analysis.

First, recall Article 11: Freedom of assembly includes right to peaceful assembly. The state may impose restrictions only if prescribed by law, pursue legitimate aim, necessary in democratic society. Also positive obligations: ensure effective respect for the right, e.g., allow peaceful assemblies, protect participants from disproportionate police action, ensure procedural remedies.

